                                "sense_id": "dd757897-29ea-3601-91d7-8956b729fdb0",
                                "text": "I braced myself and smartened my pace, shouldering my way through the crowd."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a1ed684-c66e-3549-b58f-18f492815bf4",
