                                "sense_id": "8a1ed684-c66e-3549-b58f-18f492815bf4",
                                "text": "How do we achieve this smartening of the grid? The CALM approach in the future will be to use reinforcement learning (RL) controllers as a basis for optimizing the synergy between operators and automation."
